# DMS runs on quickshell, which is Qt/QML. `rpm -qR dms` declares only
# quickshell, dgop, dms-cli, accountsservice, python3 and bash -- none of the
# QML modules it imports at runtime. A missing one gives a compositor that
# starts and a shell that silently dies, and no container gate can catch it.
# This list is therefore explicit on purpose; do not trim it without booting.
plasma-breeze
kf6-qqc2-desktop-style
kf6-kirigami
kf6-kimageformats
qt6-qtimageformats
qt6-qtmultimedia
qt6-qtdeclarative
qt6-qt5compat
qt6-qtsvg
qt6-qtshadertools
# NOT qt6-qtwayland: libQt6WaylandClient.so.6 comes from qt6-qtbase-gui on F44.
